// =============================================================================
// KIMI independent red-team (2026-07-22) — F7 floor-table BAND-EDGE fidelity.
// Every expected value below is computed OFF-CHAIN from the GBM one-touch /
// Poisson-hazard FORMULAS (sigma 0.95, load 0.20, lambda 0.08) at the band
// corner the INTENT says the band should hold — never parsed back out of the
// emitted table. A wrong comparison direction (`<` vs `<=`), a t_band_index
// boundary slip, or a pick_t index shift moves a boundary query into the
// neighboring band and flips these pins.
// =============================================================================

use aegis/floor_table.{barrier_floor_bps, depeg_floor_bps, t_band_index}

